# Jak 3: the guns Jak mans on a vehicle, aimed by the right hand (LIST-0.1.9 items 5 and 23), run with
# JAKVR_TEST_TASK=65 (city-blow-tower: the pickup's gun, bt-gun-manager) or JAKVR_TEST_TASK=54 (desert-beast-battle:
# the Scorpion's gun), JAKVR_STATE_TRACE=1. The boot of jak3_vehicle_gun.sim (a new game into play; the task plays
# after the opening, near frame 10500), then from 11000 every 800 frames: the right hand turned 30 degrees left, 30
# right, 20 down, then ahead and fired, a picture after each. Expect "[vr-gun] the pickup's gun aims where the right
# hand points" (or "the Scorpion's gun"), and the gun's reticle or barrel following the hand in the pictures. At
# 15000 the finger is lifted off the trigger once it has been seen on it (the stick's aim: the hand turned, the gun
# stays), and put back at 15800.
